  "replay": false,
  "reason": "The reply of the call workspace with the kind snapshot is the state of the registry, which the Go producer builds no project for (docs/spec/cases/page-wire/README.md#limits), and the calls setTheme, setMenuLanguage and notificationState apply to the window of the native host, which the producer does not run.",
